{"id":"vod_sn_38714","vodId":"38714","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"跳水男孩","name_cn":"跳水男孩","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/705dc718fff0c7619b4905577ed313cc.jpg"},"summary":"坂井知季（梶裕贵 配音）是一名初中二年级的学生，因为在童年时代偶然看到了富士谷要一（樱井孝宏 配音）精彩绝伦的跳水姿势而对这项运动产生了兴趣。进入中学后，知季加入了学校的跳水队，和他一起挥洒汗水的，有沉默寡言不善言辞的冲津飞沫（中村悠一 配音）、好胜心极强性格非常坦率的大广陵（逢坂良太 配音）和头脑冷静略微有些神经质的丸山礼次（内山昂辉 配音）。　　一天，队里来了一位名叫麻木夏阳子（名冢佳织 配音）的新教练，她告诉队员么，如果跳水队无法得到参加奥运会的资格的话，就将面临解散的命运。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:00","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/37S08it2w61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gkYWnuwwCA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F823NaM1Pv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/V20u4aGL881/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kfkxiqy1Xw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zufk5btCky1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nb1At3xcNd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4yMnPnmQjh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/D8KTbZjzHS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BdgFppg9Ux1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZU0FWezQuW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EjjYNDSncF1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:55.644Z"}